  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [enzyme-to-json](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json) | devDependencies | patch | [`3.4.0` -> `3.4.3`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/enzyme-to-json/3.4.0/3.4.3) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>adriantoine/enzyme-to-json</summary>\n\n### [`v3.4.3`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.4.3)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.4.2...v3.4.3)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;153](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/153) from ayouidaniel/upgrade_lodash_security_fixes  [`b68c527`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/b68c527)\n-   upgrade loadsh with security fixes  [`73581d8`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/73581d8)\n\n### [`v3.4.2`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.4.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.4.1...v3.4.2)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;152](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/152) from adriantoine/VincentLanglet-patch-2  [`9d09352`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/9d09352)\n-   Fix CI  [`d82c0f9`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/d82c0f9)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;151](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/151) from adriantoine/revert-145-johan/fix-memo  [`6d2b27a`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/6d2b27a)\n-   Revert \"Fix check of node type \"  [`581a612`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/581a612)\n\n### [`v3.4.1`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.4.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.4.0...v3.4.1)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;147](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/147) from adrienWeiss/fix-render-script  [`6bfd0ea`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/6bfd0ea)\n-   Fix script tags returning null on render  [`ae563f4`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/ae563f4)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;145](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/145) from Benjaminsson/johan/fix-memo  [`a8f9fcf`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/a8f9fcf)\n-   Update Enzyme and Enzyme adapter  [`a79dc3d`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/a79dc3d)\n-   Fix check of node type  [`38a45de`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/38a45de)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;136](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/136) from iporaitech/master  [`24d2c11`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/24d2c11)\n-   Initial documentation with example of Output mapping feature  [`bcaa151`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/bcaa151)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
